'''The Vents''' are a sub-location of the {{Zone|Walk of Fame}}. It connects the {{Zone|Cerebral Citadel}} and {{Zone|Wizardman Bureau}}.

== Trivia ==
* There is an ''Among Us'' player head peeking out through the vents: this is likely a reference to how players with the Impostor and Engineer roles can use the vents to travel to other locations quickly.

